{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1000_p", "source_sha256": "80e50f8566dbaa2c8dfe38bde8713070f0ad86db647351f264961d7a47dbe9f3", "ja": "（翼の新しい衣装は、楽曲をイメージして、\n明るく元気な方向にしてもらった……）", "zh": "（翼的新服装参考了歌曲的风格，设计得明亮又充满活力……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bbc0e6e00853a496d90c3be82f5e17fd0bfc8ddc9e6f0bbfc0b1acfa7e10a0e8", "ja": "今回のって、チアリーディングの衣装みたいですね！\nカワイくて、動きやす～い♪", "zh": "这次的衣服，感觉像是啦啦队服呢！\n既可爱，又方便活动～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3c036425c433d305257c22312bda99ef6dd555827855138dd9c7df09c414f008", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今のわたしどうですか？\n似合ってますか？　応援してもらいたくなっちゃう？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，现在的我怎么样？\n很适合我吗？会让你忍不住想为我加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1003_p", "source_sha256": "701ddfa62eac6e7de58ab5daf1c29d547055ff1cbec4f545b0536ab1944e6c72", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってる！\n今の翼に応援されたら間違いなく元気になるよ。", "zh": "啊，非常适合你！\n要是被现在的小翼加油，肯定会打起精神的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3bea118902fd5914db3858280d49dabe6899a0b2bc5cc44ecbf9cd27d5bb4b4f", "ja": "やったぁ～！　……{$P$}さんなら\nほんとに応援してあげてもいいですよ？", "zh": "太好了～！……如果是{$P$}先生的话，我真的可以给你加油哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29db7475da8d7fcb1ed9829b29fa8aaf4ecc85f49534c0b02d829502fb59b548", "ja": "フレー、フレーって♪　ポンポンはないですけど\nこの衣装だったら、それっぽくなりそうですよね……。", "zh": "加油，加油♪　虽然没有彩球，\n不过穿着这身服装的话，感觉应该也挺像的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "59e5a0e43d74251fd2029219bdd06bf0ae96bf790f5d94f3276f1f663b1067da", "ja": "どうしますか、{$P$}さん？\n今ここで応援してほしい？", "zh": "要怎么办，{$P$}先生？\n现在就想让我给你加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1007_p", "source_sha256": "74dea6ae126da271faebaae3a023efa039f24457f0a54d6b8e25ffedebbbc6f4", "ja": "ははっ。気になるけど、遠慮しておくよ。\n翼に応援してもらったら、代わりになにか……だろ？", "zh": "哈哈，虽然有点在意，不过还是算了。要是让翼给我加油，就得拿什么来回报她……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d8db897893796d068ace95e1995b80f73a40828a3eff1ee6f03e5a7e94051876", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さんノリ悪いな～。\nこういう時は、黙って、ノッてくれないと！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生太扫兴了啦～。\n这种时候，就应该什么都别说，顺着配合我一下嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5d3c5efbbd2f549b348ceca3462a1dc6b49d1c6e43a8cc6af201e42a97a88753", "ja": "今日は、こういう衣装ですし。わたしが応援した分、\nわたしのことも応援してほしいなーって。", "zh": "今天正好穿着这样的服装嘛。所以，我给你加油了，也希望你能为我加油啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "69ead1cd2946037d01a0cc722569a935221c2b1cdee958dd9a7cff3688aefa0d", "ja": "{$P$}さんが応援してくれたら、\nいつもより、ちょっとだけがんばれそうだから！", "zh": "要是能得到{$P$}先生的加油，\n感觉我就能比平时稍微多努力一点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c9be782bd6dbe135367453a59cf7e9537328fe33e2d300a7efb59876c8ed0aa7", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。\nてっきり、またデートとか色々言われるのかと……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。\n我还以为你又要说什么约会之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4e2ca0d59e3f2c9fd10dc710d194a7762857ff560c756d5354b6ef4f0432e78a", "ja": "む～。またって……。わたし、\nそんなにいっぱい言ってないと思うんだけどなぁ。", "zh": "唔～什么叫又……我觉得我也没说过那么多次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3fe0715d7425ac3bb4992e62f2a5b4cf63effdeb6b3c889144dbc424903e09ad", "ja": "なんか、今日の{$P$}さん……\nちょっとイジワルじゃないですか～？", "zh": "总觉得，今天的{$P$}先生……是不是有点坏心眼呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a5903cc5420238f025ca5ecd3ba25243212b1052f230eff1f1cea50aea51c05e", "ja": "えっ？　いじわる……か？", "zh": "咦？我很坏……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "adc6f035b9ed08103cb41b2e9dffaba50def36c1cdf87d3809868e8fea1f83ee", "ja": "うん……。この前も、お仕事中に\nわたし以外の女の子のことばっか見てたし……。", "zh": "嗯……上次也是，明明在工作，\n你却光顾着看我以外的女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1016_p", "source_sha256": "90520c55466cd83ee5d1e127b7c6622c29492c5d839e77b428d8536a0b92b906", "ja": "ええっ！？　あ、あれは……\n挨拶しに行くタイミングを見てただけで……。", "zh": "诶！？那、那是……\n我只是在看什么时候去打招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aae43494515722775d30ff7771f4e02f864ddf6f8b0fa00112e726875d74a383", "ja": "ほんとに～？　{$P$}さん、\nいつもそうやって、はぐらかすからなー……。", "zh": "真的吗～？{$P$}先生，你总是这样含糊其辞的啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fb1b98e1bc13427f00f707da8c88a33a85e4e936299c19a6470f866af93d583b", "ja": "ほ、本当だよ！\n本番中は、ちゃんと翼の活躍を見てるよ。", "zh": "真、真的啦！\n正式演出时，我有好好看着翼的表现哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c20353e6ea597095c1c48aa47680644379b72839bd0816d20a61de766a09f35d", "ja": "う～ん……\nそこまでいうなら、この間のことは許してあげる♪", "zh": "嗯～……\n既然你都这么说了，那之前的事就原谅你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0744_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4d853097b7956af28363a56aabc2db47acd4f674a97e4540759b3a091608bdb", "ja": "だからこれからは……わたしのこと、\nちゃんと見てなきゃダメだからね？　約束ですよ♪", "zh": "所以从今以后……可要好好看着我，\n不许移开视线哦？说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
